  "name": "PRENATAL SPINAL MUSCULAR ATROPHY (SMN1 GENE: EXON 7 AND 8 DELETION MUTATION SCREENING)",
  "code": "2495",
  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"1352\">\n<li data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"934\">\n<p data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"934\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Screens for <strong data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"907\">Spinal Muscular Atrophy (SMA)</strong> in a <strong data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"933\">prenatal setting</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"1064\">\n<p data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"1064\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Detects <strong data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"968\">homozygous deletion</strong> (indicative of affected fetus) or <strong data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1033\">heterozygous carrier state</strong> of <strong data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1063\">SMN1 gene (Exon 7 &amp; 8)</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1167\">\n<p data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1167\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Essential in <strong data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1111\">prenatal genetic counseling</strong> if there is a family history of SMA or carrier parents.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1220\">\n<p data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1220\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1193\">Homozygous deletion</strong> confirms diagnosis of SMA.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1278\">\n<p data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1278\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1248\">Heterozygous deletion</strong> indicates <strong data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1277\">carrier status</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1352\">\n<p data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1352\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1298\">Normal result</strong>: Both SMN1 exons 7 and 8 are present (not a carrier).</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
